# Board UI

Production board: `site/components/product-board.tsx` plus `site/components/project-card-skeleton.tsx`. Vinext does not import `project-ui` as a package.

Presentational kit + Storybook: `project-ui/src/` (`ProjectCard`, skeleton, header, filters, link/password rows). Stories in `project-ui/src/stories/`. Card samples come from `data/projects.json`.

Static/Pages board: same `product-board.tsx`, entered from `site/pages-spa/`. Build with `npm --prefix standalone run build`.

User-facing behavior must stay aligned across those three surfaces. Preserve Inter, lucide-style icons, Featured above the title, Copy/Open treatment, 1180px board width, and card-shaped skeletons while loading.

Do not restyle with unicode icons or a different typeface on Pages.
